{
  "note": "F3 permanent grouping counterexamples. Each scenario is compiled by tests/formationGrouping.test.mts through the REAL F1A -> F1B -> F1C builders, so every subject is a genuinely attested F1C result (never a clone). Fields not set default to: goal {} , acceptanceCriteria [] , independentClosure 'unknown' , occurredAt distinct-and-far unless overridden. Selectors (canonicalWorkObjectRef) are untrusted and must resolve to a member of that subject's attested object universe.",
